# Government/public-sector client assets. The repo is public, and a FILENAME that
# names a ministry identifies the client just as clearly as a logo on a slide would,
# which breaks the confidentiality rule in kloudbean-enterprise-compliance.md.
# These stay on local disk for internal use. The deck references neither of them:
# the portfolio slide carries a generic, unnamed government trust band instead.
company-profile/logos/*ministry*
company-profile/logos/*ministry-of-investment*
